      <h1>LinkedIn Personal Branding Cost + Packages Guide for Founders + CEOs + MDs (2026)</h1>
      <p class="lede">LinkedIn Personal Branding Cost + Packages tailored for Founders, CEOs, Managing Directors + Chief Executives across any industry in India + GCC. Managed end-to-end by ITD GrowthLabs. Packages from Rs 30,000/month. AI-Overview + Gemini + ChatGPT citation-optimised.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="itdgl-blog-intro">
      <p>LinkedIn personal branding cost for Founders, CEOs, Managing Directors + Chief Executives across any industry in 2026 typically ranges from Rs 30,000/month (Starter, USD 360 / AED 1,320) to Rs 1,20,000/month (Enterprise, USD 1,445 / AED 5,290). This guide breaks down 4 packages ITD GrowthLabs offers to Founders, CEOs, Managing Directors + Chief Executives across any industry, what each includes, and how to pick the right tier for your role, seniority, and audience — Investors + board members + potential hires + customers + peer CEOs + PR/media + industry-body decision-makers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-package-band">
      <h3>Our LinkedIn Personal Branding Packages</h3>
      <p>4 tiers, all managed end-to-end. INR + USD + AED pricing. Select and enquire.</p>
      <div class="pkgs">
        <span class="pkg">Starter &middot; Rs 30,000/mo</span>
        <span class="pkg">Growth &middot; Rs 40,000/mo</span>
        <span class="pkg">Premium &middot; Rs 60,000/mo</span>
        <span class="pkg">Enterprise &middot; Rs 1,20,000/mo</span>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-cta" href="/services/linkedin-personal-branding.php#packages">See All Packages + Enquire &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much does LinkedIn personal branding cost for Founders + CEOs + MDs per month?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In 2026, ITD offers 4 packages for Founders, CEOs, Managing Directors + Chief Executives across any industry: <strong>Starter Rs 30,000/mo</strong> (USD 360 / AED 1,320) — profile + 8-10 posts/month + community management; <strong>Growth Rs 40,000/mo</strong> (USD 480 / AED 1,760) — 12-16 posts + articles + video; <strong>Premium Rs 60,000/mo</strong> (USD 720 / AED 2,640) — full content + Creator Mode + newsletter + LinkedIn Live + Sales Navigator; <strong>Enterprise Rs 1,20,000/mo</strong> (USD 1,445 / AED 5,290) — for CEOs/MDs with executive content ops + LinkedIn Ads + investor narrative. See <a href='/services/linkedin-personal-branding.php#packages'>full package details + enquiry form</a>.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Which package is right for a founder or CEO?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Starter (Rs 30,000/mo) works for solo professionals starting their LinkedIn journey — profile optimization + weekly posting. Growth (Rs 40,000/mo) fits emerging founder or CEO with active BD/inbound needs — video + Reels + weekly review. Premium (Rs 60,000/mo) suits senior founder or CEO building thought leadership — Creator Mode + newsletter + LinkedIn Live drive compounding audience growth. Enterprise (Rs 1,20,000/mo) is for senior-most Founder/CEO, Managing Director, Chief Executive, Co-founder, Executive Chairman, Second-generation family-business CEO — LinkedIn Ads + investor narrative + speaking-adjacent PR + full pod dedicated to the account.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is included in the Rs 30,000/month Starter package?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Profile + About Us + banner + headline optimisation + featured section design; 8-10 LinkedIn-native posts/month written by ITD ghostwriter after voice-capture; community + comment management; response SLA 24 hrs on DMs; weekly 15-min brief calls to capture fresh material; monthly performance report showing follower growth + engagement + inbound; 1 dedicated account manager. Good starting point for Founder/CEO, Managing Director, Chief Executive, Co-founder, Executive Chairman, Second-generation family-business CEO building their first LinkedIn presence.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is included in the Rs 40,000/month Growth package?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Everything in Starter, plus: 12-16 posts/month + 1 long-form article; video + Reels production (2-4 pieces/month); carousel + graphic design; weekly performance review call; DM handling with 15-min SLA during business hours; WhatsApp handoff for qualified leads; 2-person pod (writer + designer). This is the sweet spot for scaling Founders + CEOs + MDs.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is included in the Rs 60,000/month Premium package?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Everything in Growth, plus: 16-25 posts/month + 2-3 long-form articles; Creator Mode setup + LinkedIn Newsletter management; monthly LinkedIn Live production; Sales Navigator setup + personalised InMail outreach sequences; monthly QBR + strategy call; 3-4 person dedicated pod. Ideal for senior Founder/CEO, Managing Director, Chief Executive, Co-founder, Executive Chairman, Second-generation family-business CEO building compounding audience + inbound pipeline.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is included in the Rs 1,20,000/month Enterprise package?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Everything in Premium, plus: 25-40 posts + 3-4 articles + weekly newsletter; LinkedIn Ads campaign management (Sponsored + Message + Conversation + Lead Gen Forms); speaking + PR-adjacent content workflow; investor-relations + fund-raising narrative content; company page management + employee advocacy programme; quarterly business review + board deck prep support; 5-6 person dedicated pod + senior partner access. Built for CEOs, MDs, and investor-facing Founders, CEOs, Managing Directors + Chief Executives across any industry.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Are packages in INR only, or can we pay in USD or AED?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">All 4 packages priced in INR + USD + AED. Payment accepted in INR (bank transfer/UPI/GST invoice), USD (wire/Stripe/international bank transfer), or AED (bank transfer/GCC-region invoice). For clients in GCC, we can invoice via free-zone entity — payment in AED + local VAT compliant. UK clients pay in GBP (equivalent conversion). No hidden fees — retainer + ad-spend transparent pass-through (no markup on ad-spend for Premium+ tiers).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Is there a discount for annual commitment?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Yes — 10% discount on 6-month prepaid, 15% on 12-month prepaid. Standard contract is 6-month Master Service Agreement with cancellation option after month 3 (protects both sides). Annual prepaid is best for Founder/CEO, Managing Director, Chief Executive, Co-founder, Executive Chairman, Second-generation family-business CEO committed to LinkedIn as a compounding channel — most clients see meaningful compounding month 6-12 onwards, so annual makes economic sense.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is the cheapest LinkedIn personal branding package we can start with?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Rs 30,000/month Starter is the entry tier — Rs 3.6 lakh annual, USD 360/AED 1,320 per month. Anyone offering meaningful LinkedIn personal branding for <em>less</em> is typically freelance-quality without industry expertise, compliance-safety, or dedicated team. Sub-Rs 20K packages usually deliver 4-6 posts/month with generic templates — insufficient for Founder/CEO, Managing Director, Chief Executive, Co-founder, Executive Chairman, Second-generation family-business CEO building serious LinkedIn presence.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Do we get to select the package via email form?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Yes — the package selection form on <a href='/services/linkedin-personal-branding.php#packages'>our LinkedIn service page</a> lets you pick Starter, Growth, Premium, or Enterprise (or 'Not sure — advise me') via dropdown. Fill in name + email + mobile + role + city. Your selection reaches Prashant + the ITD team via email + gets logged. We respond within 24 hours with a scoped proposal + first-30-day content plan + onboarding calendar.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Can we start Starter and upgrade later?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Yes — standard upgrade path. Start with Starter or Growth for 3-6 months to establish LinkedIn foundation; upgrade to Premium or Enterprise once your content velocity + inbound scale + budget justify. Upgrades take effect the next billing cycle with pro-rata credit. Downgrades allowed month-to-month after the initial 6-month MSA period.</div>
      </div>
